  (text "Net S180_LONG is 14.48 mm longer than S180_REF (180 deg at 5.8 GHz); S90_LONG is 7.24 mm longer than S90_REF (90 deg). 50-ohm traces are 0.37 mm wide on L4." (at 30 20.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a0f02e76-182b-5576-8852-55bc11ab7cd0))
  (text "BYP is the transmit bypass around the LNA; keep it the same electrical length in all 16 cells. No DC is allowed on the switch RF pins, hence the 5.6 pF blocks." (at 30 24.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid df4bc706-dbd9-5c35-86e7-219cc342bb4c))
  (text "RX high = receive through the LNA (and LNA enabled). All control lines low = safe power-up state." (at 30 28.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e58c9323-a7c7-5d64-81fc-84644161a2b6))
